<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Gem" data-copy-zh="Gem">Gem</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Gem, restock mining tools, learn dungeon-wall Mining, and follow her recruitment and personal routes." data-copy-zh="找到 Gem，补充采矿工具、学习地下城破墙技能，并推进招募与个人路线。">Find Gem, restock mining tools, learn dungeon-wall Mining, and follow her recruitment and personal routes.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Gem at a glance</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where and when to meet her</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Recruitment and personal route</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Daily visits, mining and worker content</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">If you get stuck</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">先认识 Gem</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">到哪里、几点找她</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">招募与个人相处</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">日常拜访、采矿与员工内容</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查这些地方</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">接下来可以查阅</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Resort_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Gem"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Gem.27s_Delve_and_Daily_Appreciation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Gem's_Delve_and_Daily_Appreciation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Stonewatch_Overlook_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Warm_Copper"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Deep_Vein_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Pickaxes_and_the_Mining_Minigame"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recruitment_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Gem at a glance</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Gem — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gem.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Gem — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gem.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Gem — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Gem is the dwarf miner at the Mountain Foothills. Learn Mining from her, follow her supply route with Lyra, and invite her to work at the Rose &amp; Thorn. Her personal conversations and overlook date can be pursued alongside recruitment.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where and when to meet her</h2><p>Find Gem at <strong>Medieval → Village Outskirts → Mountain Foothills, every day 07:00–16:59</strong>. After recruitment, her home is <strong>Gem’s Delve</strong>, reached from the <strong>Cell Corridor</strong> once that corridor is built. She is home outside her outdoor schedule, normally <strong>00:00–06:59 and 17:00–23:59</strong>. Vacations can move her away from both locations.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Main_Story_Appearances"></span><h2>Recruitment and personal route</h2><p>Follow these steps for recruitment. After the Mining lesson, the listed scenes start automatically when you enter the right room at the right time.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Step</th><th scope="col">Where and when</th><th scope="col">Additional requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Mining</th><td data-label="Where and when">Mountain Foothills 07:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Additional requirements">Friend (100); Strength 25; full version</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Short Legs, Long Road</th><td data-label="Where and when">Village Market 07:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Additional requirements">Mining lesson complete; Lyra Known</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The High Road</th><td data-label="Where and when">Mountain Foothills 07:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Additional requirements">Supply run complete; Gem and Lyra Friend</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Foundation Survey</th><td data-label="Where and when">Worker Quarters 08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Additional requirements">Close Friend (200); The High Road complete; own the Rose &amp; Thorn</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stone and Silk Contract</th><td data-label="Where and when">Worker Quarters 08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Additional requirements">Crush (400); Foundation Survey complete</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The lesson costs <strong>180 minutes, $600 and 100 Energy</strong>. Stone and Silk Contract recruits <strong>worker 14</strong>. The two Heart-to-Hearts and Stonewatch date below are a separate personal path; recruitment does not require the date.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Cost / allowance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Deep Vein Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); Short Legs, Long Road</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">75 min; 15 Energy; +10 Calm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Warm Copper</th><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); Deep Vein Talk</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">90 min; 15 Energy; +18 Calm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stonewatch Overlook</th><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); Warm Copper; 16:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">120 min; $80; 35 Energy; +15 Calm; once</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Gifts_and_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><h2>Daily visits, mining and worker content</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Cost / allowance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Gem</th><td data-label="Requirements">Mountain Foothills</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">15 min; base affection 1; five/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Jewelry</th><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">15 min; 1 Jewelry; base affection 10; twice/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Gem</th><td data-label="Requirements">Gem's Delve</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">15 min; base affection 1; four/day, separate from outdoor Talk</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Iron Pickaxes (x 5)</th><td data-label="Requirements">Available before recruitment</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">10 min; $200; five Iron Pickaxes; once/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pickaxe Haul</th><td data-label="Requirements">the service’s supporter-code unlock</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">15 min; 1 Crystal; ten each Iron, Copper, Diamond Pickaxes</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Her preferred stats are <strong>Strength 50, Stamina 50 and Technology 50</strong>; <strong>Data Mining</strong> improves affection gains. For mining controls and supplies, see the Mining guide.</p><p>After recruitment, her worker visit uses the worker shift, initially <strong>14:00–17:59</strong>, and its own daily allowance. Base visit cost is <strong>60 minutes, 60 Energy and 40 Calm</strong>. Training advances through eight options; her home and outdoor conversation remain separate activities.</p><p>At <strong>In Love</strong>, with Gem recruited and home from vacation, the following three one-time upgrades appear on her <strong>Foothills portrait,07:00–16:59</strong>. Each consumes one matching crafted gift at <strong>0 minutes and no extra Wealth cost</strong>.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Upgrade visit</th><th scope="col">Crafted item consumed</th><th scope="col">Earlier milestone completed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Nothing to Prove</th><td data-label="Crafted item consumed">Hexbound Rose Sachet</td><td data-label="Earlier milestone completed">Stonewatch Overlook</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Listen Close</th><td data-label="Crafted item consumed">Prismatic Spell Brooch</td><td data-label="Earlier milestone completed">Deep Vein Talk</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Full Weight</th><td data-label="Crafted item consumed">Void-Kissed Charm</td><td data-label="Earlier milestone completed">Mining; Deep Vein Talk</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Her resort stay also offers shared activities and a Sunset Walk. Use the linked business and resort guides for training effects, clothing and vacation planning.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>If you get stuck</h2><ul><li><strong>No Mining lesson:</strong> reach Friend, Strength 25, full-version access, and check you have not learned it already.</li><li><strong>No supply scene:</strong> return to the Village Market with Lyra Known after the lesson; The High Road needs both women at Friend.</li><li><strong>No recruitment:</strong> enter the Worker Quarters at the listed time, own the business, and finish Foundation Survey before the contract.</li><li><strong>No Stonewatch invitation:</strong> start while her Foothills portrait is still present, <strong>16:00–16:59</strong>. A later arrival misses her schedule.</li><li><strong>Wrong visit menu:</strong> Gem’s Delve Talk, outdoor Talk and worker visits use different schedules and allowances.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-mining-system.html">Mining — controls, ores and supplies</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Rose &amp; Thorn — workers, training and gifts</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort — vacations and shared activities</a></li><li><a href="character-lyra.html">Lyra — supply-route relationship</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — affection bonuses</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Resort_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Gem"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Gem.27s_Delve_and_Daily_Appreciation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Gem's_Delve_and_Daily_Appreciation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stonewatch_Overlook_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Warm_Copper"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Deep_Vein_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Pickaxes_and_the_Mining_Minigame"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recruitment_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>先认识 Gem</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Gem 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gem.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Gem 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gem.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Gem 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Gem 是山麓的矮人矿工。向她学习采矿，跟随她和 Lyra 的补给路线，就能邀请她加入玫瑰与荆棘。她的个人谈心与观景台约会可以和招募路线一起推进。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>到哪里、几点找她</h2><p>前往<strong>中世纪 → 村庄郊外 → 山脚</strong>，每天<strong>07:00–16:59</strong>都能见到她。招募后，建好牢房走廊即可从<strong>牢房走廊</strong>进入<strong>Gem的矿窟</strong>。她通常在<strong>00:00–06:59、17:00–23:59</strong>回家；度假期间请到度假村找她。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Main_Story_Appearances"></span><h2>招募与个人相处</h2><p>招募按下表推进。完成采矿教学后，后续事件会在合适时段进入对应地点时自动开始。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">步骤</th><th scope="col">地点与时段</th><th scope="col">其他条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">采矿</th><td data-label="地点与时段">山脚 07:00–16:59</td><td data-label="其他条件">朋友（Friend，100）; 力量 25；完整版</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">腿短，路长</th><td data-label="地点与时段">村庄市场 07:00–16:59</td><td data-label="其他条件">已完成采矿教学；Lyra 达到已知</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">高路</th><td data-label="地点与时段">山脚 07:00–17:59</td><td data-label="其他条件">已完成上一步；Gem 与 Lyra 都达到朋友</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">地基勘察</th><td data-label="地点与时段">员工宿舍 08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="其他条件">亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）; 已完成《高路》；拥有玫瑰与荆棘</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">石与丝绸契约</th><td data-label="地点与时段">员工宿舍 08:00–19:59</td><td data-label="其他条件">迷恋（Crush，400）; 已完成地基勘察</td></tr></tbody></table><p>采矿教学消耗<strong>180 分钟、600 财富、100 精力</strong>。完成招募契约后，Gem 成为<strong>14 号员工</strong>。下列两段谈心与观景台约会属于她的个人相处路线，招募并不要求先完成约会。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">消耗／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">深矿脉谈话</th><td data-label="条件">朋友（Friend，100）; 腿短，路长</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">75 分钟；15 精力；镇定 +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">暖铜杯</th><td data-label="条件">迷恋（Crush，400）; 深矿脉谈话</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">90 分钟；15 精力；镇定 +18</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">石望眺台</th><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（Romantic，800）; 暖铜杯; 16:00–16:59</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">120 分钟；80 财富；35 精力；镇定 +15；一次</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Gifts_and_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><h2>日常拜访、采矿与员工内容</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">消耗／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Gem 交谈</th><td data-label="条件">山脚</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">15 分钟；基础好感 1；每天五次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送珠宝</th><td data-label="条件">已知（Known，25）</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">15 分钟；1 珠宝；基础好感 10；每天两次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Gem 交谈</th><td data-label="条件">Gem的矿窟</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">15 分钟；基础好感 1；每天四次，与户外交谈分别计算</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">铁镐（x5）</th><td data-label="条件">招募前即可购买</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">10 分钟；200 财富；5 把铁镐；每天一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">镐子采购</th><td data-label="条件">需要兑换解锁该功能的支持者代码</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">15 分钟；1 水晶；铁镐、铜镐、钻石镐各 10 把</td></tr></tbody></table><p>她偏好的属性是<strong>力量 50、耐力 50、科技 50</strong>，学会<strong>数据挖掘</strong>也能提高好感收益。采矿操作和工具用法请看采矿指南。</p><p>招募后的员工拜访按工作班次开放，初始为<strong>14:00–17:59</strong>，有独立的每日次数。基础消耗为<strong>60 分钟、60 精力、40 镇定</strong>，训练会依次开放八种选项；家中与户外的交谈仍分别计算。</p><p><strong>恋爱中</strong>、已招募且未度假时，可在她的<strong>山脚头像，07:00–16:59</strong>选择下列三项一次性升级。每项消耗一个对应的制作礼物，<strong>0 分钟，不另花费财富</strong>。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">升级拜访</th><th scope="col">消耗的制作礼物</th><th scope="col">需要先完成</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">无须证明</th><td data-label="消耗的制作礼物">咒缚玫瑰香囊</td><td data-label="需要先完成">石望眺台</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">仔细聆听</th><td data-label="消耗的制作礼物">棱彩法术胸针</td><td data-label="需要先完成">深矿脉谈话</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">全部重量</th><td data-label="消耗的制作礼物">虚吻护符</td><td data-label="需要先完成">采矿; 深矿脉谈话</td></tr></tbody></table><p>她在度假村也有共同活动与日落散步，训练效果、服装和度假安排可继续查阅相关系统指南。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查这些地方</h2><ul><li><strong>没有采矿教学：</strong>确认关系为朋友、力量达到 25、拥有完整版，并且尚未学过。</li><li><strong>补给事件没有出现：</strong>教学后，让 Lyra 达到已知，再回村庄市场；后续《高路》需要两人都达到朋友。</li><li><strong>无法招募：</strong>拥有青楼后，在表中时段进入员工宿舍；先完成勘察，再等待契约事件。</li><li><strong>看不到观景台邀请：</strong>在她的山麓头像仍在时开始，实际为<strong>16:00–16:59</strong>。</li><li><strong>拜访菜单不对：</strong>家中交谈、户外交谈与员工拜访的时段、次数分别计算。</li></ul></section>
